OL,4,CSouth Korea catches 111 students with  
OL,5,Cnew measures against exam cheating     
OL,6,GSouth Korea's education ministry says  
OL,7,G111 candidates were found with         
OL,8,Gunauthorised smart devices during a    
OL,9,Ghigh-stakes nationwide exam, after     
OL,10,Gofficials introduced urgent measures   
OL,11,Gto tackle rising cases of AI-assisted  
OL,12,Gcheating.                              
OL,14,FFive of the candidates were caught red-
OL,15,Fhanded using smart devices during the  
OL,16,Fexam, authorities said on Friday.      
OL,18,FHalf a million students sat for the    
OL,19,Fcollege entry exam, also known as      
OL,20,FSuneung, which took place this week    
OL,21,Funder the shadow of several recent     
OL,22,Fhigh-profile cheating scandals.        
